The optional native packages bundle MLab Gateway, Copyright (c) 2026 mlab,
under the MIT License. The wrapper invokes only its client transport mode.
Linux x64 and ARM64 use the public v0.3.5 release assets:
https://github.com/m9rco/mlab-gateway-client/releases/tag/v0.3.5
The macOS ARM64 build uses the same MLab Gateway v0.3.5 code line.
Its default example endpoint is gateway.example; the wrapper always supplies
the user's configured server URL explicitly.

Platform packages record their exact binary SHA-256 in SHA256SUMS and their
transport version in package.json. Binary installation uses npm tarballs,
not a postinstall downloader.
